Summary:
Today’s session involved completing the final execution of the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform and verifying that all functionalities were working as expected. The system was tested to ensure smooth interaction between the frontend, backend, and database. Along with this, the focus was on preparing the final project report by organizing all sections such as abstract, modules, technologies used, and outcomes. The documentation was structured clearly to reflect the complete development process.

Outcomes:
The project was successfully executed with all core features functioning properly. A comprehensive final report was prepared, covering all important aspects of the project. The documentation and project setup are now ready for submission and presentation. This step marked the successful completion of the project with both implementation and documentation in place.
